{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tosbik Around the World is a game where you play as a sea turtle named Tosbik and you want to clean the seas from the strange stuff people threw into it! You shoot starfish to cans, plastic duckies, beach balls and more! You turn them into magical starfish and make the sea cleaner!\u00a0 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this Demo version you are  able to play the first 3 levels: A day in the Marmara Sea, a sunset in the North Sea, and a night at the Baltic Sea. You can go through a sub-selection of trash items to clean the sea from and use the first kind of powerup: A sea weed!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A day in the Marmara Sea:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848480/extras/2cce1c79c1129fe7dd225648b82a27f4.poster.avif?t=1752416743\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848480/extras/2cce1c79c1129fe7dd225648b82a27f4.webm?t=1752416743\" type=\"video/webm\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848480/extras/2cce1c79c1129fe7dd225648b82a27f4.mp4?t=1752416743\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Nights at the Baltics are very different when you have a sea weed:<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848480/extras/e31fa8d9f79abf8f574c83e9d0a63f88.poster.avif?t=1752416743\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848480/extras/e31fa8d9f79abf8f574c83e9d0a63f88.webm?t=1752416743\" type=\"video/webm\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848480/extras/e31fa8d9f79abf8f574c83e9d0a63f88.mp4?t=1752416743\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Or just have a chill time in a beautiful sunset...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848480/extras/tosbikfirsttrailer1080p-ezgif.com-video-to-gif-converter?t=1752416743\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can use your keyboard or a gamepad to control Tosbik! Turn using your directional keys and press fire ( \u201caccept\u201d button on your controller or Space key on your keyboard) to shoot stars!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3848480?t=1752416743","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3848480?t=1752416743","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848480/04e0393406ed7d477ce7f38eff2500d5bda9222c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1752416743","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848480/04e0393406ed7d477ce7f38eff2500d5bda9222c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1752416743","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tosbik Around the World is a game where you play as a sea turtle named Tosbik and you want to clean the seas from the strange stuff people threw into it! You shoot starfish to cans, plastic duckies, beach balls and more! You turn them into magical starfish and make the sea cleaner!\u00a0 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this Demo version you are  able to play the first 3 levels: A day in the Marmara Sea, a sunset in the North Sea, and a night at the Baltic Sea. You can go through a sub-selection of trash items to clean the sea from and use the first kind of powerup: A sea weed!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A day in the Marmara Sea:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848480/extras/2cce1c79c1129fe7dd225648b82a27f4.poster.avif?t=1752416743\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848480/extras/2cce1c79c1129fe7dd225648b82a27f4.webm?t=1752416743\" type=\"video/webm\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848480/extras/2cce1c79c1129fe7dd225648b82a27f4.mp4?t=1752416743\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Nights at the Baltics are very different when you have a sea weed:<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848480/extras/e31fa8d9f79abf8f574c83e9d0a63f88.poster.avif?t=1752416743\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848480/extras/e31fa8d9f79abf8f574c83e9d0a63f88.webm?t=1752416743\" type=\"video/webm\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848480/extras/e31fa8d9f79abf8f574c83e9d0a63f88.mp4?t=1752416743\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Or just have a chill time in a beautiful sunset...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848480/extras/tosbikfirsttrailer1080p-ezgif.com-video-to-gif-converter?t=1752416743\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can use your keyboard or a gamepad to control Tosbik! Turn using your directional keys and press fire ( \u201caccept\u201d button on your controller or Space key on your keyboard) to shoot stars!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["siriculo"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3807000","name":"Tosbik Around The World"},"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848480/0f40ed19ab1fdb62933809b28b1f37184e14c05f/header.jpg?t=1752416743","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257162744,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257162744/movie480.mp4?t=1752000212","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257162744/movie_max.mp4?t=1752000212"},"name":"Gameplay Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257162744/33a0ceb01c3f9d4fd0a48af477717dacf723eac7/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1752000212","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257162744/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1752000212","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257162744/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1752000212"}}],"name":"Tosbik Around The World Demo","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong